BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 742 Tm (A clear record and a clean return) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 713 Tm (Before bed, they compared the notebook with the route plan. The entries named the place,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 698 Tm (weather, time, and observer. Sketches were labeled as sketches. An uncertain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 683 Tm (identification stayed uncertain. This made the notes useful to someone who had not stood) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 668 Tm (beside the telescope.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 644 Tm (In the morning, Mira counted the items on the table before packing them: mug, notebook,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 629 Tm (clip, lantern, and telescope case. Papa Bear checked the designated campsite for scraps) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 614 Tm (and loose equipment. They left the site as clear as they had found it and followed the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 599 Tm (same marked path back toward the harbor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 575 Tm (At the overlook, the footbridge looked different again in the morning light. Mira added) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 560 Tm (a third small drawing to the first page. Nothing in the old sketches needed to be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 545 Tm (erased. Together, the views showed how position and light could change an honest) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 530 Tm (observation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 506 Tm (Back at the open window, the teal mug returned to its place beside the folded map. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 491 Tm (trip had produced four pages of notes, three small sketches of the footbridge, and one) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 476 Tm (useful habit: describe the evidence before deciding what it means. Their next walk could) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 461 Tm (begin with that habit, without needing a more dramatic story.) Tj ET
